/* â”€â”€ Transcript Download â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€ */
function downloadTranscript() {
    Swal.fire({ title: 'Generating Transcript...', html: 'Preparing your PDF', allowOutsideClick: false, didOpen: function() { Swal.showLoading(); } });
    fetch('/api/cgpa/transcript')
    .then(function(r) { return r.json(); })
    .then(function(d) {
        Swal.close();
        if (d.error) { Swal.fire({ icon: 'error', text: d.error }); return; }
        if (!d.semesters || d.semesters.length === 0) { Swal.fire({ icon: 'info', text: 'No courses logged yet.' }); return; }
        Swal.fire({ title: 'Downloading...', html: 'Opening your official transcript PDF', allowOutsideClick: false, didOpen: function() { Swal.showLoading(); } });
        window.location.href = '/api/cgpa/transcript/pdf';
        setTimeout(function() { Swal.close(); }, 1500);
    })
    .catch(function(err) { Swal.close(); Swal.fire({ icon: 'error', text: 'Failed: ' + (err.message || 'network error') }); });
}

function buildTranscriptHtml(d) {
    var today = new Date();
    var dateStr = today.toLocaleDateString('en-GB', { day:'numeric', month:'long', year:'numeric' });
    var timeStr = today.toLocaleTimeString('en-GB', { hour:'2-digit', minute:'2-digit' });
    var gpMap = (d.gradingScale === '5') ? {A:5,B:4,C:3,D:2,E:1,F:0} : {A:4,B:3,C:2,D:1,F:0};
    var totalPassed = 0;
    d.semesters.forEach(function(s) { s.courses.forEach(function(c) { if (c.grade !== 'F' && !c.excluded) totalPassed++; }); });

    var html = '<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Official Transcript - ' + (d.student.name || 'Student') + '</title>' +
        '<style>@page { margin: 20mm 16mm 16mm; }body { font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif; color: #0f172a; font-size: 9.5pt; line-height: 1.45; margin: 0; padding: 0; }.header { text-align: center; padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 3px double #0f172a; margin-bottom: 20px; }.header .inst { font-size: 18pt; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0; }.header .title { font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 700; margin: 4px 0 6px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #1e293b; }.header .divider { width: 80px; height: 1.5px; background: #0f172a; margin: 6px auto; }.header .sub { font-size: 7.5pt; color: #475569; font-weight: 600; }.header .ref { font-size: 7pt; color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 4px; }.info-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 18px; font-size: 9pt; }.info-table td { padding: 3px 6px; vertical-align: top; }.info-table .lbl { font-weight: 700; color: #475569; width: 130px; font-size: 7.5pt; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.3px; }.info-table .sep { width: 12px; text-align: center; color: #cbd5e1; font-weight: 600; }.info-table .val { font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; }.sem-block { margin-bottom: 16px; }.sem-header { font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: 800; color: #1e293b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.8px; padding: 6px 8px; background: #f1f5f9; border-bottom: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1; margin-bottom: 4px; }table.grades { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 8pt; }table.grades th { background: #f8fafc; padding: 5px 6px; text-align: left; font-weight: 700; font-size: 6.5pt; color: #475569; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }table.grades td { padding: 4px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }table.grades tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }.sem-gpa td { background: #f8fafc; font-weight: 700; border-top: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1; border-bottom: none !important; font-size: 7.5pt; }.summary-box { margin-top: 18px; padding: 14px 16px; background: #0f172a; color: white; border-radius: 4px; }.summary-box .row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }.summary-box .item { text-align: center; flex: 1; }.summary-box .item .lbl { font-size: 6pt; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.8px; opacity: 0.5; }.summary-box .item .num { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: 800; margin-top: 2px; }.summary-box .item .cls { font-size: 8pt; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 2px; }.footer-note { text-align: center; font-size: 6.5pt; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 16px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; line-height: 1.6; }.footer-note strong { color: #64748b; }.watermark { position: fixed; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(-30deg); font-size: 72pt; font-weight: 800; color: rgba(0,0,0,0.025); pointer-events: none; z-index: -1; letter-spacing: 8px; white-space: nowrap; }@media print { body { -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; } }</style>' +
        '</head><body>' +
        '<div class="watermark">PREPIUM</div>' +
        '<div class="header">' +
            '<div class="inst">Prepium</div>' +
            '<div class="divider"></div>' +
            '<div class="title">Official Transcript of Academic Record</div>' +
            '<div class="sub">Student-Owned Academic Record &mdash; For Verification Purposes</div>' +
            '<div class="ref">Reference: ' + (d.refNumber || 'N/A') + ' &nbsp;|&nbsp; Issued: ' + dateStr + ' at ' + timeStr + '</div>' +
        '</div>' +
        '<table class="info-table"><tr>' +
            '<td class="lbl">Student Name</td><td class="sep">:</td><td class="val">' + (d.student.name || 'N/A') + '</td>' +
            '<td class="lbl" style="width:100px">Department</td><td class="sep">:</td><td class="val">' + (d.department || 'N/A') + '</td>' +
        '</tr><tr>' +
            '<td class="lbl">Current Level</td><td class="sep">:</td><td class="val">' + (d.currentLevel || 'N/A') + ' Level</td>' +
            '<td class="lbl">Grading Scale</td><td class="sep">:</td><td class="val">' + d.gradingScale + '-Point System</td>' +
        '</tr></table>';

    d.semesters.forEach(function(sem) {
        var semesterName = 'Level ' + sem.level + ' &mdash; ' + (sem.semester === '1' ? 'First' : 'Second') + ' Semester';
        html += '<div class="sem-block">' +
            '<div class="sem-header">' + semesterName + '</div>' +
            '<table class="grades"><thead><tr>' +
                '<th style="width:16%">Code</th><th style="width:42%">Course Title</th>' +
                '<th style="width:10%;text-align:center">Unit</th><th style="width:10%;text-align:center">Grade</th>' +
                '<th style="width:10%;text-align:center">GP</th><th style="width:12%;text-align:center">Status</th>' +
            '</tr></thead><tbody>';
        sem.courses.forEach(function(c) {
            var gp = gpMap[c.grade] || 0;
            var excl = c.excluded ? ' style="opacity:0.5;text-decoration:line-through"' : '';
            var status = c.excluded ? 'Excluded' : (c.grade === 'F' ? 'Fail' : 'Pass');
            var statusColor = status === 'Pass' ? '#16a34a' : (status === 'Fail' ? '#ef4444' : '#6b7280');
            html += '<tr' + excl + '><td style="font-weight:700">' + (c.code || '') + '</td>' +
                '<td>' + (c.title || '') + '</td>' +
                '<td style="text-align:center">' + c.units + '</td>' +
                '<td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700">' + c.grade + '</td>' +
                '<td style="text-align:center">' + gp.toFixed(1) + '</td>' +
                '<td style="text-align:center;font-size:6.5pt;font-weight:600;color:' + statusColor + '">' + status + '</td></tr>';
        });
        var semGpa = sem.units > 0 ? (sem.points / sem.units).toFixed(2) : '0.00';
        html += '<tr class="sem-gpa"><td colspan="2" style="font-size:7pt;color:#475569">Semester Grade Point Average (SGPA)</td>' +
            '<td style="text-align:center">' + sem.units + '</td>' +
            '<td style="text-align:center;color:#0062ff">' + semGpa + '</td>' +
            '<td style="text-align:center">' + sem.points.toFixed(1) + '</td>' +
            '<td style="text-align:center;font-size:6.5pt;color:#475569">' + sem.courses.filter(function(c){ return c.grade !== 'F' && !c.excluded; }).length + '/' + sem.courses.filter(function(c){ return !c.excluded; }).length + ' passed</td></tr>';
        html += '</tbody></table></div>';
    });

    html += '<div class="summary-box"><div class="row">' +
        '<div class="item"><div class="lbl">Cumulative GPA (CGPA)</div><div class="num">' + d.cgpa + '</div></div>' +
        '<div class="item"><div class="lbl">Total Units Registered</div><div class="num">' + d.totalUnits + '</div></div>' +
        '<div class="item"><div class="lbl">Courses Passed</div><div class="num">' + totalPassed + '</div></div>' +
        '<div class="item"><div class="lbl">Degree Classification</div><div class="cls">' + (d.degreeClass || 'N/A') + '</div></div></div></div>' +

        '<div class="footer-note">' +
        '<strong>NOTICE:</strong> This transcript is generated from student-provided academic records. ' +
        'It serves as a personal academic summary and is not an official university-issued document. ' +
        '<br>Reference: ' + (d.refNumber || 'N/A') + ' &nbsp;|&nbsp; Generated: ' + dateStr + ' &nbsp;|&nbsp; Prepium CGPA Tracker' +
        '</div>' +
        '</body></html>';

    return html;
}

